1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,532
The cab was empty.

2
00:00:01,532 --> 00:00:04,880
And it had followed me
for three hundred miles.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,518
Wyoming.

4
00:00:06,518 --> 00:00:07,103
2004.

5
00:00:07,103 --> 00:00:09,330
Two in the morning.

6
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:12,440
Same headlights in my mirror.

7
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,770
Mile after mile.

8
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,918
I slowed down.

9
00:00:15,918 --> 00:00:17,470
It slowed down.

10
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:19,565
I pulled over.

11
00:00:19,565 --> 00:00:21,060
It pulled over.

12
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:25,630
At the next truck stop, I finally
walked back to see who it was.

13
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:27,637
Engine running.

14
00:00:27,637 --> 00:00:28,509
Lights on.

15
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:30,600
Driver's door wide open.

16
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,609
I stepped up...

17
00:00:32,609 --> 00:00:34,180
and looked inside.

18
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,380
Full story's on the channel.

19
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,010
And the cab...
